# Claudemux manual-mode patterns.
# Copy this file to  ~/.claude/claudemux/manual-patterns  and uncomment/add globs.
# Any session whose cwd matches a glob below registers in MANUAL mode: peers can see it in
# `/cm peers`, but the relay will NEVER type /cm recv into it (no other session can drive a turn
# there). Use it for sensitive workspaces. One shell glob per line; # starts a comment.
#
# Examples:
# *emr*
# *legal*
# *secret*
# */clients/*
